  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1229700/description_2c8ea66d-0e5e-44a2-8382-e2b3616ce9e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"802\" height=\"648\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/thumbnails/053/064/910/small/celestial-border-with-magic-moon-and-mystic-stars-astrology-ornament-with-spiritual-symbols-of-sun-esoteric-vintage-minimal-decoration-spiritual-frame-with-fantasy-elements-png.png\" alt=\"免費下載奇幻邊框 PNG\" width=\"290\" height=\"89\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4WvV3EzxdP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1347707912642101308?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"237\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>一款魂系黑暗奇幻 RPG</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9446af3-440c-4222-a904-19b561a9becb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\" height=\"65\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;獨特且具衝擊力的戰鬥動畫與機制，包含超過 100 種專屬招式 <strong>(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Epic Fight</span>)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>自訂招式展示：</strong></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Awakened Lichblade</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/awakened_lichblade.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"144\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/demonic_lichblade.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Hearthflame</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/hearthflame_berserk.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/hearthflame_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/hearthflame_skill.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Runic Scythe</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/runic_scythe_innate_skill.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"144\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/runic_scythe_traveler.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"144\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/runic_scythe_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"531\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Whisperwind</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_basic_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"141\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_deadly_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"141\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_innate_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_sheath_innate.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_true_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;全面重製的奇幻世界觀、建築結構、城鎮等。<strong>(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Integrated Structures</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Luki's Grand Capitals</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Explorify</span>)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong>&nbsp; 根據戰況觸發的動態戰鬥音樂 (<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Mob Battle Music</strong></span>)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;自訂並重製的材質貼圖，完美契合奇幻中世紀風格<strong>(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Excalibur</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Addons</span>)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;豐富的 Boss 戰內容，並融入精煉的 ARPG 元素<strong>(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Cataclysm</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Mowzie's</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Soulslike Weaponry</span>)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong>&nbsp; 數百種具備獨特機制的全新武器<strong>(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Simply Swords</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Epic Knights</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Dungeons and Combat</span>)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;內容詳盡的技能樹與等級系統，提供多種職業可供選擇<strong>(<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Passive Skill Tree</span>, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Just Leveling)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>建議 JVM 參數：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-XX:+UnlockExperimentalVMOptions -XX:+UnlockDiagnosticVMOptions -XX:+AlwaysActAsServerClassMachine -XX:+AlwaysPreTouch -XX:+DisableExplicitGC -XX:+UseNUMA -XX:NmethodSweepActivity=1 -XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=400M -XX:NonNMethodCodeHeapSize=12M -XX:ProfiledCodeHeapSize=194M -XX:NonProfiledCodeHeapSize=194M -XX:-DontCompileHugeMethods -XX:MaxNodeLimit=240000 -XX:NodeLimitFudgeFactor=8000 -XX:+UseVectorCmov -XX:+PerfDisableSharedMem -XX:+UseFastUnorderedTimeStamps -XX:+UseCriticalJavaThreadPriority -XX:ThreadPriorityPolicy=1 -XX:AllocatePrefetchStyle=3</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🖥️ 系統需求</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️ 最低規格</strong> <strong>記憶體 (RAM)：</strong>6GB (已分配) <strong>顯示卡 (GPU)：</strong>&nbsp;RTX 2060 / GTX 1660 Ti <strong>處理器 (CPU)：</strong>&nbsp;Ryzen 5 5600X</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>✅ 推薦規格</strong> <strong>記憶體 (RAM)：</strong>10GB (或約佔總量的 65%) (已分配) <strong>顯示卡 (GPU)：</strong>&nbsp;RTX 4060 <strong>處理器 (CPU)：</strong>Ryzen 7 7800X3D</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🧪 測試平台</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>MacBook</strong> M1 / M2 / M3 / Neo</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Windows</strong> AMD / Intel</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Linux</strong> AMD / Intel</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特別感謝</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Odd_Turtle</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Nesil</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>soldierdonkey</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Ms Blind</strong></li>\n<li><strong>GunnerX（藝術家）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Grim（藝術家）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Ruseki（材質製作）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>oni7suKa（材質製作）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Starlezz（材質製作）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>lowpolycat（材質製作）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我們擁有官方<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapotheoticstudios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a>！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapotheoticstudios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_91b78000-80f8-4031-95e3-1f7542d33ed3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"134\"></strong></a></p>",
